# Custom shortcuts for the gnome-base module, one per line:
#   name|command|binding
# Lines are parsed with the shared list grammar: blanks and `#` comment
# lines (leading whitespace allowed) are ignored, the rest is one entry
# with exactly two `|` separators. The binding uses GNOME accelerator
# syntax (e.g. <Ctrl><Shift>Escape). Carried over from the prototype
# (scripts/add_custom_shortcut.sh).
Resources|flatpak run net.nokyan.Resources|<Ctrl><Shift>Escape
Settings|gnome-control-center|<Super>I
Terminal|gnome-terminal|<Alt>T
Toggle Mic|amixer set Capture toggle|<Alt>1